      "traditional": "意思是重複一件已經做過或者說過的事情，沒有什麼新的內容。",
      "pinyin": "yì si shì chóng fù yí jiàn yǐ jīng zuò guò huò zhě shuō guò de shì qing méi yǒu shén me xīn de nèi róng",
      "english": "In fact, “to stir-fry leftover rice” is a common saying in China."
    },
